{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49545","headline":"临江仙 二 · 尹鹗","name":"临江仙 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"深秋寒夜银河静，月明深院中庭。\n西窗幽梦等闲成。\n逡巡觉後，特地恨难平。\n红烛半条残焰短，[依]稀暗背银屏。\n枕前何事最伤情。\n梧桐叶上，点点露珠零。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"尹鹗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49545.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49545","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}